# Part of sys-mud-snow: Route 212 South on a frozen date (2009-01-06: THUNDERSTORM in the decomp's
# sYearlyWeather). Stepping into deep mud (531, 845) gets the player stuck: holding up does not move
# them. Five changes of direction get them out (decomp FieldTask_StuckInDeepMud), then they walk on.
date 2009-01-06
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_212_SOUTH 531 846 up
until idle
+0 assert state weather "platinum:OVERWORLD_WEATHER_THUNDERSTORM"
+0 press up
until position 531 845
+60 release up
+5 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_212_SOUTH 531 845
+0 press left
+10 release left
+0 press right
+10 release right
+0 press left
+10 release left
+0 press right
+10 release right
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_212_SOUTH 531 845
+0 press left
until position 530 845 30
+0 release left
until idle
